    "beats": [
      {"function": "hook", "scene_type": "zonk_scan", "source_ids": ["S1", "S2"],
       "spoken": "A starfish is not a fish. I invited it to a swim race. No reply.",
       "data": {"mode": "hook", "head": "A starfish is *not* a fish.", "head_at": 0.2, "sign": "ANIMALS ONLY",
                "items": [{"kind": "starfish"}], "stamp_reject": "NOPE",
                "cue_scan": "starfish", "cue_verdict": "not", "cue_club": "race", "cue_know": "reply"}},
      {"function": "problem", "scene_type": "zonk_word", "source_ids": ["S1"],
       "spoken": "Wait. I thought a starfish was a star-shaped fish. But it has no gills, no scales, no fins. I was shocked. So was the fish next door.",
       "data": {"word_a": "Star", "word_b": "fish", "left": "Plümo: *a star fish*", "right": "Real: *no gills*",
                "cue_left": "thought", "cue_strike": "But", "cue_right": "gills", "cue_react": "was",
                "item": "fish", "cue_shock": "shocked", "cue_item": "fish", "cue_never": "door"}},
      {"function": "explanation", "scene_type": "zonk_diagram", "source_ids": ["S1", "S2", "S3"],
       "spoken": "So what is it? An echinoderm, an animal with no backbone. Its relatives: sea urchins, sand dollars and sea cucumbers. No hands, so I point with my leaf.",
       "data": {"headline": "So what *is* it?", "inner": "starfish", "disc": ["#0B3A5C", "#BFE4FF", "#5FA8F0"], "cue_q": "is",
                "labels": [{"text": "an *echinoderm*", "pos": "tr", "cue": "echinoderm"},
                           {"text": "no *backbone*", "pos": "l", "cue": "backbone"},
                           {"text": "relatives: *sea urchins*", "pos": "b", "cue": "urchins"}],
                "cue_hands": "hands", "cue_leaf": "leaf"},
       "overlay": {"marker_at": "w:echinoderm"}},
      {"function": "demonstration", "scene_type": "zonk_zoom", "source_ids": ["S1"],
       "spoken": "Closer. On its underside sit tiny tube feet. That's how it moves. And instead of blood, seawater pumps nutrients through its body. Sounds like plumbing.",
       "data": {"kind": "starfish", "lens": "starfish", "lens_bg": "#0B2A44", "cue_mag": "Closer",
                "callouts": [{"text": "underside: *tube feet*", "cue": "tiny"}, {"text": "seawater, *not blood*", "cue": "seawater"}],
                "cue_nut": "moves", "stamp": {"text": "Tube feet!", "cue": "Sounds"}, "cue_react": "plumbing"},
       "overlay": {"dim_at": "w:tube", "marker_at": "w:tube"}},
      {"function": "insight", "scene_type": "zonk_compare", "source_ids": ["S1"],
       "spoken": "And how many arms? Not every starfish has five. Some species have ten, twenty, even forty. Lose an arm, and it grows back. There are about two thousand species, all in the sea. My leaf won't.",
       "data": {"headline": "How many *arms*?",
                "bars": [{"label": "arms", "value": "5", "h": 0.15, "color": "#F0643A", "cue": "five"},
                         {"label": "arms", "value": "10", "h": 0.25, "color": "#F0643A", "cue": "ten"},
                         {"label": "arms", "value": "20", "h": 0.5, "color": "#F0643A", "cue": "twenty"},
                         {"label": "arms", "value": "40", "h": 1.0, "color": "#FF8A5A", "cue": "forty"}],
                "stamp": {"text": "grows back!", "cue": "grows"}, "cue_react": "leaf"},
       "overlay": {"marker_at": "w:ten"}},
      {"function": "benefit", "scene_type": "zonk_scan",
       "spoken": "Remember: a starfish is an echinoderm, not a fish. Right, my turn. I swim with my leaf as a fin. Scanner on. Result: species unknown. I spin in circles.",
       "data": {"mode": "unknown", "sign": "ANIMALS ONLY", "merke": "Starfish: *echinoderm*, not fish.",
                "display": "Species: unknown", "plumps": "FLOP", "cue_build": "echinoderm",
                "cue_go": "Right", "cue_scan": "Scanner", "cue_result": "Result", "cue_back": "spin"},
       "overlay": {"marker_at": "w:Remember"}},
      {"function": "close", "scene_type": "zonk_loop",
       "spoken": "I'll just lie here for a bit. More Zonkfruit? Follow the channel. I'll get up in a minute.",
       "data": {"sign": "ANIMALS ONLY", "cta": "More Zonkfruit? *Follow.*", "cue_cta": "More", "cue_up": "get", "cue_lie": "lie", "cue_ch": "channel"}}
    ],
